  "statement": "# CityCab Rush — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nDrive a toy-like taxi through a compact city, collect fares, deliver them under time pressure, and finish a complete shift.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA bounded 3D arcade driving game with pickup/delivery, a clock or score pressure, success, failure, and replay.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the road layout, fare placement, traffic pressure, handling, and city dressing.\n"
